7,                         $ Link Path Size
"21 0F 00 24 1C 30 01",    $ Link Path to param instance.  The param instance decodes
                           $ the enumerated parameter.
0x0002,                    $ No support for settable path, scaling, scaling links,
                           $ or real time update of value.  Value is gettable and
                           $ Settable.  Enumerated strings are supported.
0xD1,                      $ Data Type - 8 bit string
1,                         $ Data Size - (in bytes)
"Zone Cnxn #3 - Mask",     $ Parameter Name
"",                        $ Units String
           $$$$$$$$$$ Help string $$$$$$$$$$$
"Use this mask to specify which bytes of the Zone data are meaningful.  Each byte that is selected will be saved.  Bytes not selected will be discarded.  Selected bytes will be concatenated in order. NOTE, this parameter in conjunction with the connection's offset specifies the Zone data and where it is placed.  Be careful not to exceed the total length of Zone data space.",
0,0x1F,0,                   $ Min, Max (max enumeration #), and Default values
,,,,,,,,;                  $ Not Used
Enum26 =   0, "Byte 0",
           1, "Byte 1",
           2, "Byte 2", 
           3, "Byte 3", 
           4, "Byte 4";
           
